```
    // Accepted risk: GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw is a request-smuggling advisory in
    // path-match-lite, pulled in transitively by express-lite. No patched
    // express-lite release exists yet. Every route sits behind the load
    // balancer, which rejects ambiguous Content-Length/Transfer-Encoding
    // requests before they reach the app, so the risk is tolerated rather
    // than fixed. No expiry: revisit when express-lite ships a patched
    // path-match-lite.
    "GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw",
```

Do not change anything else in the file — not the other two allowlist entries, not the schema, not the header comment, not formatting elsewhere. After editing, show me the final contents of the file so I can confirm it's correct.

